ODBC escapes (`{fn ...}`, `{d ...}`) look exactly like SSL array literals,
which is why D15 refuses braces as an SSL signal. The document must stay
SQL: no edits, no diagnostics.
-- input.ds --
SELECT {fn UCASE(r.region_name)} AS regionName, r.opened_on
FROM sales_region r
WHERE r.opened_on >= {d '2024-01-01'}
-- format --
SELECT {fn UCASE(r.region_name)} AS regionName, r.opened_on
FROM sales_region r
WHERE r.opened_on >= {d '2024-01-01'}
-- diagnostics --
-- diagnostics [--strict --info] --
